1d:["$","div",null,{"className":"site-shell content-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"content-main","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"editorial-contact","children":["Published by ",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/editorial-policy/","children":"AspireCompass Editorial Team"}]," · Editorial contact: ",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/team/hafiz-umar-farooq/","children":"Hafiz Umar Farooq"}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"quick-answer","aria-labelledby":"quick-answer-title","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"quick-answer-title","children":"The short answer"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Campus France’s official Eiffel MASTER portal lists 6 January 2027 at 23:59 CET for institutional submissions. Students first meet their French host’s own internal procedure and deadline; the institution submits the nomination. A host’s support is not a final scholarship award."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"answer-next","children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Next step:"}]," ","Find the intended master’s programme and its host’s Eiffel contact. Obtain the internal deadline and evidence list before planning backwards."]}],"$undefined"]}],"$undefined",false,false,false,null,["$","details",null,{"className":"mobile-contents","children":[["$","summary",null,{"children":"On this page: jump to your answer"}],["$","nav",null,{"aria-label":"Article sections","children":[["$","a","Identify who submits which record",{"href":"#section-1","children":"Identify who submits which record"}],["$","a","Use a host-specific deadline before the national one",{"href":"#section-2","children":"Use a host-specific deadline before the national one"}],["$","a","Build a backwards nomination plan with real dependencies",{"href":"#section-3","children":"Build a backwards nomination plan with real dependencies"}],["$","a","Make an evidence register instead of a generic document bundle",{"href":"#section-4","children":"Make an evidence register instead of a generic document bundle"}],["$","a","Explain course fit through a career question you can defend",{"href":"#section-5","children":"Explain course fit through a career question you can defend"}],["$","a","Keep admission, nomination and a usable budget separate",{"href":"#section-6","children":"Keep admission, nomination and a usable budget separate"}],["$","a","Follow up with the right question after internal submission",{"href":"#section-7","children":"Follow up with the right question after internal submission"}]]}]]}],false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,false,["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","section","Identify who submits which record",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Identify who submits which record"}],[["$","p","The official MASTER portal states that only French higher-education institutions submit Eiffel nomination files. Its published 2027 closing instant is 6 January 2027, 23:59 CET, or 22:59 UTC. That national timestamp is the institution’s outer submission deadline, not a universal student deadline.",{"children":"The official MASTER portal states that only French higher-education institutions submit Eiffel nomination files. Its published 2027 closing instant is 6 January 2027, 23:59 CET, or 22:59 UTC. That national timestamp is the institution’s outer submission deadline, not a universal student deadline."}],["$","p","The student selects an appropriate course and follows the host’s internal procedure. The host decides whether to support and submit the nomination. Campus France then administers the national selection. Keep the records separate so that an admission conversation or an internal acknowledgement is not mistaken for a funded award.",{"children":"The student selects an appropriate course and follows the host’s internal procedure. The host decides whether to support and submit the nomination. Campus France then administers the national selection. Keep the records separate so that an admission conversation or an internal acknowledgement is not mistaken for a funded award."}],"$L1f"],"$undefined","$L20","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L21"]}]]}],"$L22",false,false,false,"$L23",false,"$L24","$L25"]}],"$L26"]}]
