28:["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Use a host-specific deadline before the national one","children":[["$","$L5","https://www.universite-paris-saclay.fr/admission/bourses-et-aides-financieres/bourses-france-excellence-eiffel",{"href":"https://www.universite-paris-saclay.fr/admission/bourses-et-aides-financieres/bourses-france-excellence-eiffel","children":["Read Paris-Saclay’s host-specific Eiffel procedure",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]
29:["$","section","2-Build a backwards nomination plan with real dependencies",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a backwards nomination plan with real dependencies"}],[["$","p","Start with the host’s actual internal deadline, then identify the slowest evidence items. A ranking certificate, academic transcript, language record or institution-specific form can depend on another office. Ask what is accepted before ordering a translation or paying for a service.",{"children":"Start with the host’s actual internal deadline, then identify the slowest evidence items. A ranking certificate, academic transcript, language record or institution-specific form can depend on another office. Ask what is accepted before ordering a translation or paying for a service."}],["$","p","The following schedule is invented to demonstrate sequencing. Suppose the host’s student cutoff is 26 November and an academic record takes eight working days to obtain. Record the issuing office’s own estimate and holidays; do not simply count eight calendar days. Place a private inspection step before the final upload so that a mismatch can be corrected.",{"children":"The following schedule is invented to demonstrate sequencing. Suppose the host’s student cutoff is 26 November and an academic record takes eight working days to obtain. Record the issuing office’s own estimate and holidays; do not simply count eight calendar days. Place a private inspection step before the final upload so that a mismatch can be corrected."}],["$","p","A buffer is useful when it is tied to a real dependency. It is not a guaranteed processing period or an extension. If an item will be late, seek the host’s explicit current instruction and keep the remaining condition unresolved until it is answered.",{"children":"A buffer is useful when it is tied to a real dependency. It is not a guaranteed processing period or an extension. If an item will be late, seek the host’s explicit current instruction and keep the remaining condition unresolved until it is answered."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Build a backwards nomination plan with real dependencies","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Build a backwards nomination plan with real dependencies"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Preparation task",{"scope":"col","children":"Preparation task"}],["$","th","Dependency to check",{"scope":"col","children":"Dependency to check"}],["$","th","Ready state",{"scope":"col","children":"Ready state"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Academic records"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Issuer, format, language and actual lead time"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Correct official record received"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Career/project statement"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Host prompt and allowed length"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Specific, accurate final draft inspected"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Language evidence"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Course’s accepted proof and required stage"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Required result available in permitted form"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Internal submission"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Host recipient, cutoff and complete-file rule"}],"$L2e"],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2a:["$","section","3-Make an evidence register instead of a generic document bundle",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Make an evidence register instead of a generic document bundle"}],[["$","p","Paris-Saclay lists academic records, a CV and a professional-project statement among its master’s evidence. The exact host list controls. A list copied from a different institution may omit a required ranking record or ask for material your host does not need.",{"children":"Paris-Saclay lists academic records, a CV and a professional-project statement among its master’s evidence. The exact host list controls. A list copied from a different institution may omit a required ranking record or ask for material your host does not need."}],["$","p","Create a private register with the document purpose, issuer, version, translation and submission state. Compare identity, institution names and award dates across files. If a transcript is corrected, inspect any statement that quotes its marks so that one change does not create a contradiction elsewhere.",{"children":"Create a private register with the document purpose, issuer, version, translation and submission state. Compare identity, institution names and award dates across files. If a transcript is corrected, inspect any statement that quotes its marks so that one change does not create a contradiction elsewhere."}],["$","p","Original fictional mismatch: a CV gives a placement ending in September, while the career statement describes the same work as a full year. The applicant checks the true dates and their own contribution before submission. They do not lengthen a period to make the file look stronger or alter someone else’s recommendation to fit their draft.",{"children":"Original fictional mismatch: a CV gives a placement ending in September, while the career statement describes the same work as a full year. The applicant checks the true dates and their own contribution before submission. They do not lengthen a period to make the file look stronger or alter someone else’s recommendation to fit their draft."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2b:["$","section","4-Explain course fit through a career question you can defend",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Explain course fit through a career question you can defend"}],[["$","p","A useful preparation note connects past study, a concrete learning need and the intended course. This is an original worksheet for thinking; it is not a motivation letter for you to copy. Use your own evidence and the host’s current application rules.",{"children":"A useful preparation note connects past study, a concrete learning need and the intended course. This is an original worksheet for thinking; it is not a motivation letter for you to copy. Use your own evidence and the host’s current application rules."}],["$","p","Fictional example: an engineering graduate has compared energy use in a small process project. They want to learn a particular modelling approach offered by the selected master’s and investigate how that approach could improve the measurement problem they actually encountered. Their claim is a learning goal, not proof that the method will solve a national problem.",{"children":"Fictional example: an engineering graduate has compared energy use in a small process project. They want to learn a particular modelling approach offered by the selected master’s and investigate how that approach could improve the measurement problem they actually encountered. Their claim is a learning goal, not proof that the method will solve a national problem."}],["$","p","For each sentence, ask what evidence supports it and which part of the curriculum makes the course relevant. Distinguish an individual contribution from a team result. Keep uncertain future outcomes as aims rather than promises, and leave the institution to judge academic suitability.",{"children":"For each sentence, ask what evidence supports it and which part of the curriculum makes the course relevant. Distinguish an individual contribution from a team result. Keep uncertain future outcomes as aims rather than promises, and leave the institution to judge academic suitability."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Explain course fit through a career question you can defend","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Explain course fit through a career question you can defend"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Career-fit worksheet",{"scope":"col","children":"Career-fit worksheet"}],["$","th","Question to answer",{"scope":"col","children":"Question to answer"}],["$","th","Evidence boundary",{"scope":"col","children":"Evidence boundary"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Past task"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"What did you personally do?"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Do not claim the whole team’s work"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Learning gap"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"What method or knowledge is missing?"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Name an honest gap rather than invented expertise"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Course connection"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Which actual teaching/research setting fits?"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Use the real curriculum"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Future use"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"What problem would you like to investigate?"}],"$L2f"],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2c:["$","section","5-Keep admission, nomination and a usable budget separate",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep admission, nomination and a usable budget separate"}],[["$","p","A host may support a nomination while separate academic admission tasks remain. Record those conditions explicitly: final qualification evidence, language, course application or later enrolment. A scholarship process should not cause you to miss the programme’s ordinary application route.",{"children":"A host may support a nomination while separate academic admission tasks remain. Record those conditions explicitly: final qualification evidence, language, course application or later enrolment. A scholarship process should not cause you to miss the programme’s ordinary application route."}],["$","p","For money, use the actual award terms and course fee rules. Do not infer that every tuition charge, housing cost or initial payment is covered from the scholarship’s name. A private planning table should distinguish a confirmed fee exemption, an allowance, a service, a later reimbursement and an unresolved cost.",{"children":"For money, use the actual award terms and course fee rules. Do not infer that every tuition charge, housing cost or initial payment is covered from the scholarship’s name. A private planning table should distinguish a confirmed fee exemption, an allowance, a service, a later reimbursement and an unresolved cost."}],["$","p","Original arithmetic example: an invented €700 housing deposit and €300 initial travel cost create €1,000 to arrange before those bills fall due. A possible future allowance does not make that amount available today. Replace the example with verified quotations, confirmed support and real payment dates before making commitments.",{"children":"Original arithmetic example: an invented €700 housing deposit and €300 initial travel cost create €1,000 to arrange before those bills fall due. A possible future allowance does not make that amount available today. Replace the example with verified quotations, confirmed support and real payment dates before making commitments."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2d:["$","section","6-Follow up with the right question after internal submission",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow up with the right question after internal submission"}],[["$","p","Keep the internal acknowledgement, host contact and final files in one private record. If the host requests a correction, identify exactly which document and stage it concerns. Retain the corrected version and the host’s response rather than assume an offline edit has updated the institution’s file.",{"children":"Keep the internal acknowledgement, host contact and final files in one private record. If the host requests a correction, identify exactly which document and stage it concerns. Retain the corrected version and the host’s response rather than assume an offline edit has updated the institution’s file."}],["$","p","A precise question identifies the course, degree level, cycle and the rule you cannot apply. Avoid sending sensitive academic or identity documents to unrelated accounts. Use the institution’s published channel for the requested material.",{"children":"A precise question identifies the course, degree level, cycle and the rule you cannot apply. Avoid sending sensitive academic or identity documents to unrelated accounts. Use the institution’s published channel for the requested material."}],["$","p","If your host’s deadline has passed, the still-visible national portal does not prove that a late student file can be accepted. Ask about the host’s actual current process and research other suitable options without presenting them as guaranteed routes. Institutional support and final scholarship selection remain separate decisions.",{"children":"If your host’s deadline has passed, the still-visible national portal does not prove that a late student file can be accepted. Ask about the host’s actual current process and research other suitable options without presenting them as guaranteed routes. Institutional support and final scholarship selection remain separate decisions."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2e:["$","td","2",{"children":"Receipt or confirmation for that stage"}]
2f:["$","td","2",{"children":"A plan is not a guaranteed impact"}]
